% A query whose plan calls a function is gathered, since a call may fail on
% any binding and no row may be delivered before nothing can; the same
% query without the call streams.  One that only filters by a call is
% gathered too, whatever its head holds.
file("a.c"). file("b.h").

file(P)?
file(P), index(P, ".c") >= 0?
file(P), N = length(P)?
